  "gap_builder_rules": [
    "Every gap receives owner, acceptance tests, sandbox coverage, security/permission boundaries and a local-first implementation path.",
    "Benchmark GitHub user outcomes, not proprietary internals.",
    "Make the default DreamCo experience simpler than GitHub: plain-language request, automatic owner routing, test evidence and one control center.",
    "Do not call parity complete while any benchmark feature remains a gap or while required runtime evidence is missing."
  ],
  "truth_rule": "This benchmark covers major GitHub platform capabilities relevant to DreamCo's open-source development platform goal; GitHub evolves continuously, so the benchmark itself must be refreshed rather than treated as a permanent complete list."
